Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.66,0:00:01.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}All over the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}people are quietly using
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.41,0:00:05.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}AI to make life better,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.67,0:00:07.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for people, for animals,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.33,0:00:09.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for the planet itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.75,0:00:10.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Most of these projects,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.83,0:00:12.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}you've probably never heard of.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.31,0:00:14.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In India, a train
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.55,0:00:15.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}brakes in the dark
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.55,0:00:16.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for elephants its
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.49,0:00:17.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}driver can't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.23,0:00:19.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In California, a man
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.69,0:00:20.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}silenced by illness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.83,0:00:23.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}speaks again, in his own voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.25,0:00:25.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It makes people cry
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.72,0:00:27.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}who have not heard me in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.62,0:00:29.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And in Peru's desert,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.90,0:00:31.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}ancient drawings are
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.28,0:00:32.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}coming to light.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.72,0:00:34.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}All of it is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.26,0:00:34.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It's the same kind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.96,0:00:35.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of tool that writes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.84,0:00:37.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}your emails and picks your ads.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.18,0:00:39.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A few people pointed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.22,0:00:41.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it at something far bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.36,0:00:42.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This is what AI
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.42,0:00:43.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}should be used for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.98,0:00:44.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}What do all these
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.64,0:00:46.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}tools have in common?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.36,0:00:47.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A first clue:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.14,0:00:48.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the last of them learned
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.54,0:00:49.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}where floods strike
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.68,0:00:51.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}from old news reports.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.76,0:00:54.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}At the far edge of New Zealand,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.51,0:00:56.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a tiny radio station
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.07,0:00:57.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}set out to build
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.15,0:00:59.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}something no tech giant had:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.79,0:01:00.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a machine that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.77,0:01:02.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}understands spoken Māori.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.19,0:01:04.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}To learn a language,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.35,0:01:06.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a machine has to hear it,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.45,0:01:08.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for hours and hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.76,0:01:12.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The station asked its own people.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.26,0:01:14.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In just ten days, they read enough
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.30,0:01:15.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Māori into their
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.24,0:01:16.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}phones to build it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.08,0:01:17.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A global data
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.78,0:01:19.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}company wanted recordings
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.12,0:01:20.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}like these too,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.56,0:01:21.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and offered to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.24,0:01:23.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The station said no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.20,0:01:26.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Peter Lucas Jones runs it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.26,0:01:28.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This is how he explained the no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.96,0:01:30.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}We're a charity,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.49,0:01:32.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}we're a Māori charity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.33,0:01:33.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And so we look at ways
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.96,0:01:35.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to maintain sovereignty
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.56,0:01:37.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}because we know what it means
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.66,0:01:39.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to lose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.19,0:01:43.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}We know that data is the new land.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.09,0:01:45.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A machine can't keep
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.37,0:01:46.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a language alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.87,0:01:48.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Only speakers can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.71,0:01:49.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.51,0:01:51.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the speakers own the machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.02,0:01:55.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That machine was built to listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.46,0:01:57.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In Australia, another AI
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.20,0:01:58.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}was built to waste time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.92,0:02:00.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}On purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.64,0:02:02.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.34,0:02:03.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A phone scammer's.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.18,0:02:05.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A researcher there once
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.30,0:02:06.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}kept a scammer on the line
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.66,0:02:07.100,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for about forty minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.04,0:02:10.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}during a family picnic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.24,0:02:11.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}All that time,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.06,0:02:12.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the scammer wasn't
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.20,0:02:13.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}robbing anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.98,0:02:15.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Now his company does it all day,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.74,0:02:17.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}with AI victims:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.74,0:02:19.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}chatty strangers with all
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.16,0:02:20.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the time in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.86,0:02:21.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}One of Australia's big
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.94,0:02:23.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}phone networks already
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.30,0:02:24.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}sends scam calls
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.46,0:02:26.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}straight to these bots.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.88,0:02:30.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Here, the AI wins by being slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.38,0:02:32.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Over Wyoming, it has to be fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.31,0:02:36.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Wind turbines make clean power,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.11,0:02:38.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and they kill eagles.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.85,0:02:39.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Stop them all,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.53,0:02:41.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and you lose the power.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.67,0:02:43.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Stop none, and eagles die.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.33,0:02:45.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}What would you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.79,0:02:48.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}On one wind farm in Wyoming,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.53,0:02:51.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}cameras on towers watch the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.67,0:02:52.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In the blink of an eye,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.65,0:02:55.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}an AI decides: eagle or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.27,0:02:57.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Only the turbines
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.17,0:02:59.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in its path slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.43,0:03:00.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A study credited
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.41,0:03:01.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the cameras with cutting
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.61,0:03:02.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}eagle deaths there
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.67,0:03:05.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}by more than four in five.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.09,0:03:06.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Other scientists say one wind
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.89,0:03:08.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}farm can't prove that yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.32,0:03:12.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Here, one miss can cost an eagle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.37,0:03:13.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In Peru, a machine
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.55,0:03:15.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}was wrong almost every time,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.89,0:03:17.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and it still worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.57,0:03:19.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The Nazca desert is famous
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.98,0:03:21.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for its giant drawings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.24,0:03:23.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}An AI combed aerial
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.54,0:03:25.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}photos of it and flagged
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.22,0:03:27.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}tens of thousands of spots.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.88,0:03:29.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Almost all of them were nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.22,0:03:31.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Archaeologists checked only
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.62,0:03:32.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the best leads on site,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.98,0:03:34.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and nearly doubled
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.10,0:03:35.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the figures known there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.82,0:03:36.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The new ones are small,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.86,0:03:37.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and they sit close
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.88,0:03:39.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to ancient footpaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.86,0:03:40.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The team's reading:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.24,0:03:42.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the giant drawings
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.14,0:03:44.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}were made for community rituals.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.08,0:03:45.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The small ones,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.04,0:03:46.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for people walking past.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.38,0:03:50.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The AI didn't need to be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.88,0:03:51.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It only had to tell
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.78,0:03:53.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}people where to look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.12,0:03:55.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But what happens when
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.18,0:03:56.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the machine points,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.06,0:03:58.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and no one looks?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.48,0:04:01.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Methane is invisible, and it heats
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.63,0:04:03.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the planet far faster
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.09,0:04:04.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}than carbon dioxide.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.97,0:04:06.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}To catch every leak,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.29,0:04:07.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}you'd need eyes over
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.47,0:04:08.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the whole planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.76,0:04:11.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}They're already up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.52,0:04:12.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Satellites built to watch
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.74,0:04:14.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}fields and forests
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.14,0:04:16.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}can catch methane's faint shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.78,0:04:18.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Every day, an AI searches
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.44,0:04:20.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}their pictures for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.28,0:04:21.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Experts check, and the UN
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.02,0:04:23.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}warns the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.86,0:04:25.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In Algeria, one leak had been
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.74,0:04:26.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}visible from space
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.96,0:04:28.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for over a decade.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.82,0:04:30.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Months after the alerts,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.16,0:04:31.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.30,0:04:34.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But that's the exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.07,0:04:35.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Nearly nine in ten alerts
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.45,0:04:37.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}still get no answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.41,0:04:38.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Two years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.17,0:04:40.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}almost none got one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.69,0:04:42.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Seeing isn't saving.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.25,0:04:45.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Casey Harrell knows exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.84,0:04:47.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}what he wants to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.72,0:04:49.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}His brain still sends the words.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.68,0:04:52.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But his lips no longer follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.50,0:04:55.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}He has ALS He said it felt
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.86,0:04:57.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}like being trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.72,0:04:58.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}How do you hear a sentence
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.92,0:05:01.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that never leaves the body?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.16,0:05:04.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Surgeons placed tiny sensors where
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.38,0:05:05.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}his brain steers
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.48,0:05:07.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}his lips and tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.30,0:05:08.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}An AI learned which
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.60,0:05:10.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}signals mean which sounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.86,0:05:13.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It doesn't read his thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.36,0:05:15.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Only the words he's trying to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.53,0:05:17.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then it speaks them,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.82,0:05:19.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in his own voice,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.16,0:05:20.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}rebuilt from recordings
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.70,0:05:22.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}made before he fell ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.06,0:05:24.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This is that voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.11,0:05:26.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}People who do not have the ability
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.27,0:05:27.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to communicate well or quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.66,0:05:30.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}are often isolated and lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.23,0:05:31.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Having something like this will
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.38,0:05:32.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}give them hope and opportunity
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.61,0:05:33.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to be more of themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.63,0:05:36.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It's one man, in a research study,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.83,0:05:37.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}not yet a treatment
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.95,0:05:39.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}anyone can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.73,0:05:41.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But at home, in under two years,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.93,0:05:43.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}he spoke almost two
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.29,0:05:45.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}million words with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.24,0:05:46.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This channel exists
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.98,0:05:48.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for one reason:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.78,0:05:49.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}so that the arrival
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.48,0:05:50.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of superintelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.58,0:05:52.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}goes well for everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.74,0:05:53.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Want that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.44,0:05:54.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then subscribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.29,0:05:57.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Casey wants to be heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.50,0:05:58.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Out at sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.26,0:05:59.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}some ships would
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.36,0:06:01.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}rather not be seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.37,0:06:03.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Big ships are supposed
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.31,0:06:04.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to broadcast where they are,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.93,0:06:06.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}on a radio built so
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.39,0:06:07.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}they don't collide.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.97,0:06:09.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Take a guess: how many industrial
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.93,0:06:11.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}fishing boats stay
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.11,0:06:12.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}off the public map?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.49,0:06:14.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}An AI compared years
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.87,0:06:15.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of radar pictures
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.93,0:06:18.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}from space with those broadcasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.57,0:06:21.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The answer: about three in four.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.79,0:06:23.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Dark doesn't mean illegal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.57,0:06:24.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But it's where the worst
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.91,0:06:26.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}things can hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.61,0:06:28.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Another AI reads how ships move,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.67,0:06:30.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and flags those whose crews
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.57,0:06:32.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}may not be free to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.99,0:06:35.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That's a risk, not a verdict.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.82,0:06:36.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A ship can hide
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.83,0:06:39.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}by switching its radio off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.31,0:06:41.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A tsunami hides in plain sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.29,0:06:44.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In the open ocean,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.42,0:06:46.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it's barely a ripple.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.46,0:06:47.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}How do you see it coming
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.40,0:06:49.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}before it reaches land?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.88,0:06:50.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Look up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.98,0:06:52.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The rising water shoves
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.34,0:06:53.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the air above it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.92,0:06:55.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That push climbs all
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.32,0:06:56.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the way to space,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.46,0:06:58.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}where it makes GPS signals
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.08,0:07:00.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}arrive a tiny bit late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.50,0:07:01.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The same signals your phone
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.70,0:07:03.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}uses to find your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.68,0:07:04.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Another clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.88,0:07:06.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}An AI learned to read
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.38,0:07:08.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the tsunami's fingerprint in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.65,0:07:10.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}NASA switched it on the day before
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.87,0:07:11.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a giant earthquake
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.99,0:07:13.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}struck off Russia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.11,0:07:15.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}NASA's replay shows it catching
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.79,0:07:17.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the wave in the sky over Hawaii,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.89,0:07:19.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}half an hour before
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.21,0:07:21.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the first tide gauge there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.27,0:07:23.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It's still a research tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.17,0:07:23.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Half an hour can
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.97,0:07:25.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}warn a whole coast.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.87,0:07:27.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But you can't warn an elephant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.15,0:07:30.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You're driving a train at night,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.84,0:07:31.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}through an elephant
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.80,0:07:33.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}corridor in southern India.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.28,0:07:34.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}By the time your
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.92,0:07:36.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}lights find an elephant
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.10,0:07:36.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}on the track,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.92,0:07:38.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it's too late to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.52,0:07:41.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Unless the track sees it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.28,0:07:43.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Cameras on towers along
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.48,0:07:45.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the line see heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.30,0:07:47.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}An AI spots the elephant and warns
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.54,0:07:49.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the driver and the rangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.40,0:07:50.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This time, the warning
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.42,0:07:51.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}gets an answer:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.66,0:07:53.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the train brakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.42,0:07:53.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}On the stretch
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.88,0:07:55.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it watches, officials say,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.50,0:07:56.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}no train has killed
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.98,0:07:58.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}an elephant since it went live.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.63,0:08:01.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Elephants are the giants here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.98,0:08:02.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But across India,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.02,0:08:04.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a far smaller animal
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.84,0:08:05.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}kills about a hundred
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.72,0:08:07.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}times more people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.86,0:08:09.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It hides in the grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.77,0:08:11.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.49,0:08:12.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Its bite is still
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.01,0:08:14.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}treated with medicine
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.05,0:08:15.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}made from the blood
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.13,0:08:16.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of horses and sheep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.23,0:08:18.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}What if you could skip the horse,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.79,0:08:20.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and design a molecule no
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.51,0:08:22.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}living thing has ever made?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.05,0:08:26.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A lab asked an AI to do just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.27,0:08:28.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It designed brand new proteins,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.23,0:08:29.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}shaped to grab a snake's
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.73,0:08:31.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}toxin and switch it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.75,0:08:33.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In mice, they worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.77,0:08:34.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Most survived a dose
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.83,0:08:36.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that should have killed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.65,0:08:38.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So far only in mice,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.29,0:08:40.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and only against single toxins,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.47,0:08:41.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}not whole venom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.62,0:08:43.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A designed protein can
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.99,0:08:45.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}stop a poison in the blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.23,0:08:48.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But can a machine change a mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.12,0:08:51.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Everyone knows you can't argue
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.74,0:08:52.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}someone out of
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.60,0:08:54.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a conspiracy theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.52,0:08:56.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Researchers tried anyway:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.38,0:08:56.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}they let believers
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.00,0:08:58.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}argue with an AI
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.00,0:09:00.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Just an ordinary chatbot,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.64,0:09:02.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the kind that writes emails.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.74,0:09:04.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It answered each person's
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.16,0:09:06.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}own reasons with evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.46,0:09:07.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}David Rand, one
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.62,0:09:08.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of the researchers,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.54,0:09:10.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}on why it worked:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.59,0:09:11.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And when you look at what
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.56,0:09:13.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the model does, it just sort of
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.37,0:09:15.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}politely presented
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.02,0:09:17.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}non-conspiratorial explanations
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.79,0:09:19.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and contradictory facts
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.38,0:09:20.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.94,0:09:22.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}After one short conversation,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.77,0:09:25.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}belief dropped by about a fifth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.49,0:09:27.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Months later, it was still down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.89,0:09:28.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The authors later found
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.01,0:09:31.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}errors in their own data.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.25,0:09:33.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Corrected, the effect still held.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.53,0:09:35.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In a newer study,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.99,0:09:37.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}not yet peer reviewed,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.73,0:09:39.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the same team flipped it:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.67,0:09:40.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a chatbot argued
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.69,0:09:42.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for the conspiracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.61,0:09:44.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Belief went up just as strongly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.49,0:09:46.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Same tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.47,0:09:47.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Opposite aim.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.49,0:09:49.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}What do all these
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.49,0:09:51.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}tools have in common?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.32,0:09:53.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Flash floods are
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.12,0:09:54.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the deadliest floods.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.00,0:09:56.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}They often hit places where
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.26,0:09:58.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}no one measures the water,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.26,0:09:59.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}so a machine has almost
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.52,0:10:01.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}nothing to learn from.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.21,0:10:03.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Except the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.83,0:10:05.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A team at Google pulled millions
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.49,0:10:07.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of past floods out of old
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.29,0:10:09.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}news reports, to teach an AI
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.59,0:10:11.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}where flash floods strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.79,0:10:12.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}For big rivers,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.59,0:10:14.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Google's flood forecasts
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.29,0:10:16.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}already reach up to a week ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.83,0:10:17.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The warnings show up
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.81,0:10:19.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in Search, in Maps,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.65,0:10:22.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and as alerts on ordinary phones.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.67,0:10:23.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Maybe on yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.66,0:10:27.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But a forecast isn't a rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.29,0:10:28.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Like those methane alerts,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.85,0:10:29.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it only works
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.65,0:10:31.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}if someone acts in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.99,0:10:34.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Satellites built to watch
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.22,0:10:36.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}fields and forests.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.36,0:10:37.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A radio built so
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.44,0:10:39.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}ships don't collide.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.34,0:10:42.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}GPS, built to find your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.20,0:10:44.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}An everyday chatbot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.20,0:10:46.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Old news, written for readers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.14,0:10:49.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}None of it was built for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.48,0:10:50.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That's what these
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.06,0:10:51.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}tools have in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.72,0:10:52.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The difference between
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.48,0:10:53.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}writing your emails
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.56,0:10:54.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and saving a life
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.82,0:10:56.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}was never the tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.54,0:10:57.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It was the aim.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.82,0:10:59.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The tool is already here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.78,0:11:00.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The question is what
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.82,0:11:02.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}we point it at.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.83,0:11:04.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That's why this channel exists:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.52,0:11:05.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}so that superintelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.00,0:11:07.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}goes well for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.06,0:11:08.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Want that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.70,0:11:09.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then subscribe.
